    },
    {
      "q": "What does L3HARRIS Technologies sell to the government?",
      "a": "L3HARRIS Technologies sells services and products that fall largely into Engineering Services, Custom Computer Programming Services, and Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing. Engineering Services generated $106M, Custom Computer Programming Services generated $66.3M, and Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing generated $62.1M in FY2026 to date. Other markets include Satellite Telecommunications at $23.4M and Search, Detection, Navigation, Guidance, Aeronautical, and Nautical System and Instrument Manufacturing at $16.9M."
